{"title":"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered four-tuples of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aaed2f1a79a88452200331149dfae2d963c005e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)\\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/12098ffca09bdd324ecf4993c7b09c088378a375.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; a &lt; b &lt; c &lt; d &lt; 500\\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"191\" height=\"13\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d129bccba34b7945ea92dd4bff19bb6223f0a140.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + d = b + c\\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/f/9bf1738dc05944d53829c37d2874e2ec8eeb31c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc - ad = 93\\,$\" width=\"98\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaaf9d5ea8f18d7820fb1c849c659faeb22da7b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = a + d = b + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40e32e974ce9ebb1a316c6ceb0338c22c0a76618.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = k-a, b=k-c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"156\" height=\"16\" />. It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/f/f4f9caec84c3b8a61629a9f5671f970436aec7e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k-c)c - a(k-a) = (a-c)(a+c-k) = (c-a)(d-c) = 93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"487\" height=\"18\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/78162926613113205a76bddd7ea31fc32e2dc5d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c - a,d - c) = (1,93),(3,31),(31,3),(93,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"346\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Solve them in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> to get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/1/bf12fbef3c7096b63c568f73b1ba6dc2ad62cca7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d) = (c - 93,c - 92,c,c + 1),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"283\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f17c5534b1a2960911751c8d1d71eafa2131c516.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c - 31,c - 28,c,c + 3),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/4/15445d5e3efdc59a53b4ede414cf8523b064f72c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c - 1,c + 92,c,c + 93),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"185\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/2/9825cfc15bdeab6f40a6ff9e6ece076eb8b65f09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c - 3,c + 28,c,c + 31)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" />. The last two solutions don't follow <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79aaead4a185db1b2c9c7ccf238bd329165edfc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; b &lt; c &lt; d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />, so we only need to consider the first two solutions.\n</p><p>The first solution gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3d3162f4e31c3580b4f36e8d4b25a06fe14e466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - 93\\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/e/dfeed64620001b029175ddd792f76699efe7aed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c + 1\\leq 499$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/3/db3e73accd2b829500df7a723cdf89c1b7170dd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies 94\\leq c\\leq 498$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\" />, and the second one gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc65dd72459e6368137632a12d5d7ab712f2faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32\\leq c\\leq 496$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>So the total number of such quadruples is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e494e2e4e07be00a1c8f60e90c4be73057aee092.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405 + 465 = \\boxed{870}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4bfcd726bc6a6630aae84971e0acd47b44d9333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a + m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/5293d84aefc1de4cfdd38435007330e46129faf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a + m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"12\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/818091c444ab6197a968e0b76308f59b18927229.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + d = b + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/036bc0b1f1236d43302a950392559d3c4de66404.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = b + c - a = a + 2m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"217\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4bfcd726bc6a6630aae84971e0acd47b44d9333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a + m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/5293d84aefc1de4cfdd38435007330e46129faf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a + m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/036bc0b1f1236d43302a950392559d3c4de66404.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = b + c - a = a + 2m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"217\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/63911d77aa13c70cfa668850f758a05826c28136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc - ad = 93$\" width=\"98\" height=\"12\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/0/30086f9da02c78ef830da685a79f9dde74153553.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[bc - ad = (a + m)(a + m + n) - a(a + 2m + n) = m(m + n). = 93 = 3(31)\\]\" width=\"523\" height=\"18\" />\nHence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cd6759cb6241cafeae6d2e75591ca5f1238b0bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n) = (1,92)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/b/9cb6b9029686ac535e9fe64d055c9e8269849014.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,28)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cd6759cb6241cafeae6d2e75591ca5f1238b0bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n) = (1,92)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66e5c14b627ad2d849eda3fdb359c07f4071d049.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; a &lt; a + 1 &lt; a + 93 &lt; a + 94 &lt; 500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"307\" height=\"14\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc228bd77701d8bed244703342dd3cee93bd56c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> four-tuples. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/5022537d2b44d3a38ea738040aaee72e8b3454e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n) = (3,28)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd03e30f4c3fd3f2ed6651bd1859a859561a8a10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; a &lt; a + 3 &lt; a + 31 &lt; a + 34 &lt; 500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"307\" height=\"14\" />, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae47528e052e84ea2bdabeb381af47f83bf7809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$465$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> four-tuples. In total, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e494e2e4e07be00a1c8f60e90c4be73057aee092.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405 + 465 = \\boxed{870}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" /> four-tuples.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Square both sides of the first equation in order to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe207dd510fa3e2012d9747d93de6f9cc71bf3f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc$\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df74cf2db193657a668ecbe12f59c0630c0fab2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ad$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> terms, which we can plug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72f553051fe3bcf42965f99d1a10ac6efed037e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in for.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e3886eb7a017ac3313763e245cd92164a3267a43.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (a+d)^2 = (b+c)^2 &amp;\\implies a^2 + 2ad + d^2 = b^2 + 2bc + c^2 \\\\ &amp;\\implies 2bc-2ad = a^2-b^2 + d^2-c^2 \\\\ &amp;\\implies 2(bc-ad) = (a-b)(a+b)+(d-c)(d+c) \\end{align*}\" width=\"534\" height=\"72\" />\nWe can plug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72f553051fe3bcf42965f99d1a10ac6efed037e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77de6c059b9802641cc7fe3ae62508da2dcc1aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc - ad$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36b7a198fe50fc705ae2ae67870167886d18cc7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$186$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> on the left side, and also observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a8908d7b33c39b64494624792fa52f602a821e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b = c-d$\" width=\"103\" height=\"12\" /> after rearranging the first equation. Plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/989be1a6aacb19a0e5a48c7a991abcee4bab8303.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-d$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a697bfdeadf2105048670e6f6c7d4dc6878dc4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/609793279e89fb29934e2bacccf98fc57de1d9cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$186 = (c-d)(a+b) + (d-c)(d+c) \\implies 186 = -(d-c)(a+b) + (d-c)(d+c) \\implies 186 = (d-c)(d+c-a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"909\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Now observe the possible factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36b7a198fe50fc705ae2ae67870167886d18cc7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$186$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, which are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/0/f809d67cad02a98ed13e0afa60fbf494d5155fdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\cdot 186, 2\\cdot 93, 3 \\cdot 62, 6\\cdot 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"194\" height=\"16\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/636a2a5e08353b56605edbfd5aeb093a8eaba822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d-c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b4f2c7c6af1c9cc8df754afa7cff689679a65f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d+c-a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" /> must be factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36b7a198fe50fc705ae2ae67870167886d18cc7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$186$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b4f2c7c6af1c9cc8df754afa7cff689679a65f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d+c-a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" /> must be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/636a2a5e08353b56605edbfd5aeb093a8eaba822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d-c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5ba102412c42367721530e8a66ba971663b74d81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\cdot 186$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" /> work, and yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc228bd77701d8bed244703342dd3cee93bd56c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> possible solutions.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/b/5bba37e94bd5984e806c583bad2dbaeb89bda2cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 93$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> does not work, because if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/8/2183b180aae71b842db267e42d1138f26d181a07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-d = 2$\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> must differ by 2 as well, but an odd number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72f553051fe3bcf42965f99d1a10ac6efed037e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> can only result from two numbers of different parity. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/989be1a6aacb19a0e5a48c7a991abcee4bab8303.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-d$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> will be even, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> will be even, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/1/ed1e9d01fd68104c9f7c6a6bfac28eef2b8e9306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+d - (a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" /> must be even.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/0/fa01be8fa1ebdb52f8774a941038341cd6973e4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 62$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> works, and yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae47528e052e84ea2bdabeb381af47f83bf7809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$465$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> possible solutions, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/a/e9a03d198d9f18ce864b17de3b04bee827d17e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> fails for the same reasoning above.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e494e2e4e07be00a1c8f60e90c4be73057aee092.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405 + 465 = \\boxed{870}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Add the two conditions together to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/d/e1d8bf7825c38f2f64eb8a6488ee2c98ecb782a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d+ad+93=b+c+bc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"223\" height=\"14\" />. Rearranging and factorising with SFFT, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e88778031e468c935820a02bd5482a5ad2d205f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)(d+1)+93=(b+1)(c+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"279\" height=\"18\" />. This implies that for every quadruple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faedb9d30dc3763d92cbcacf2cc17e2bf64f3e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" />, we can replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c6c677c397610f0f341af8db384aa831969667f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\longrightarrow a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/3/753c465fa940cae0d4fa80d420ddfb84d5d4eed0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\longrightarrow b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />, etc. and this will still produce a valid quadruple. This means, that we can fix <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, and then just repeatedly add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get the other quadruples. \n</p><p>Now, our conditions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/1477104565a37941215cb5d003fd9ee2f1376768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c=d+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/1257f612d127fbc4fbb8846c3c6bf045190ac759.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc=d+93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" />. Replacing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the first equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e8de46dad4b200bc3675eb00f52128c52db0a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc-b-c=92$\" width=\"117\" height=\"12\" />. Factorising again with SFFT gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/c/19c070e5162f0baf5271c2a9d73438c4c79fe85d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b-1)(c-1)=93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20afa9d430964d658067093a97b8f0e4a6865cb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, we have two possible cases to consider.\n</p><p>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb0f1d96984bd857beb95dbe23c8f730f7d48c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=94$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />. This produces the quadruple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f3194e8bedeff27435469c80c99c30946b5a799c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2,94,95)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />, which indeed works.\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda5328bc4703ff88e62aa83ea58ae4e8361f5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89b4b18384f26a4ae3450e2457a5321fa5d9c684.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=32$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />. This produces the quadruple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/38933ed2f4dd20b1247d57affdba4718ed9a9591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,4,32,35)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />, which indeed works. \n</p><p>Now, for case 1, we can add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to each term exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c966a8bbbfff128d433f2021f9993ed52e87fcbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$404$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> times (until we get the quadruple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/8/0388b372a12976511b9443b63f14bf63507763da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(405,406,498,499)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />), until we violate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39c94944c13df098b5ad509be08b8505a5edfd75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d&lt;500$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />. This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc228bd77701d8bed244703342dd3cee93bd56c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> quadruples for case 1.\n</p><p>For case 2, we can add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to each term exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/660c87b2cd3b569b0bb15a970f3469ae40b4da9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$464$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> times (until we get the quadruple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/d/3ddd78115ec272aa27dc2cf814375573fd07a053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(465,468,496,499)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />). this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae47528e052e84ea2bdabeb381af47f83bf7809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$465$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> quadruples for case 2.\n</p><p>In conclusion, having exhausted all cases, we can finish. There are hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/3628f4fae7ee71fd3f2c36a9c21c2f1d0da61fa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405+465=\\boxed{870}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" /> possible quadruples.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/1/6a10de7a346a66b26d4e9b58a344e04bfc6601d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = d-c$\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" />. From the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4bef29718a1134b9da83d66c7aa02306e0e3367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d = b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4ed23c5195b1ff907efc6a596a9e704673945409.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r = d-c = b-a ,\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/0/200496962dafae99659e8f3b8f2ddeaa8d01b126.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d633beeb98ff4bf949cb80319f164ed0e7228ac5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = d-r$\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" />. We then have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/251817508efb57866482c38cc11ded0efed5411a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[93 = (a+r)(d-r) - ad = rd - ra - r^2 = r(d-a-r) .\\]\" width=\"436\" height=\"19\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f773d031c2cc283675e9da7ef72d7bd5d1a82db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &gt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/e/7bebacbdced1cd0fa8d95dde40e10aa717cb205c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-r &gt; a+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77d82dfc5640c4de4aa36ef00314a0263e3012b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-a-r &gt; r$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />. Since the prime factorization of 93 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd069fe80e147e5a8d4879b7760d2c17133f15df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" />, we must either have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/1930619a38fceee8e02990ea79026a348193307e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/5/445b6c2692577a2e7d16d2b2b41b0920bca83617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-a-r = 93$\" width=\"114\" height=\"12\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31faa8c684ba5811ac60ea1bd0c855d8ef4d8b16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a43d42ecd0c48edd9e6d04a5b100e433574a430a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-a-r = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" />. We consider these cases separately.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/1930619a38fceee8e02990ea79026a348193307e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc4e956e3beb05bd7c6ca86f0484898f13d622ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-a = 94$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9ebfad03f9d8b58ddd1d58a507a1acc3d9e1a96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b= a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/3/9f38e8802c9e9ec6b85730bab463e0138be45c12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = d-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be any integer between 95 and 499, inclusive, and our choice of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> determines the four-tuple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faedb9d30dc3763d92cbcacf2cc17e2bf64f3e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" />. We therefore have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/0747136d900a917b1b934afe3d90056b05604edf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$499-95+1 = 405$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"149\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities in this case.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31faa8c684ba5811ac60ea1bd0c855d8ef4d8b16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f346a90355aed75948cf444828b114601bad996.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-a = 34$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e7b57e4d2a1922e63ffcc7bcddfa740245acc24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/38935d6a856cd41dfd2267396e5e163956ed7480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=d-3$\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be any integer between 35 and 499, inclusive, and our choice of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> determines the four-tuple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faedb9d30dc3763d92cbcacf2cc17e2bf64f3e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" />, as before. We therefore have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/a/48adce176a37cb17f21bb1139aceed14b4a0a7ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$499-35+1 = 465$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"149\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities in this case.\n</p><p>Since there are 405 possibilities in the first case and 465 possibilities in the second case, in total there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e494e2e4e07be00a1c8f60e90c4be73057aee092.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405 + 465 = \\boxed{870}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" /> four-tuples.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/f/41ffd6f29780383d476aac662dc951e8d3809d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = x+m, a = x-m, c = x+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"256\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/d/a2d2cc3bead00f0c9752832923afb0531eb4b8ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = x-n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" />. This clearly satisfies the condition that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4bef29718a1134b9da83d66c7aa02306e0e3367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d = b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> since (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69ce9a7ab2415992e6caa99ca0958f7dd43c7e68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 2x$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />) . Now plug this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/5/b8551ed50b2b289a7fec1b96ce5e46382fbdd464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc-ad = 93$\" width=\"98\" height=\"12\" />. You get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/2241dd4af8a0dd42f943a444f7cc3ed23bf3a3d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+n)(x-n) - (x+m)(x-m) = 93 \\Rightarrow m^2 - n^2 = 93 \\Rightarrow (m-n)(m+n) = 93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"636\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c1867cd31fa2542f75b0c24655922d93ce901d81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"10\" /> (as given by the condition that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/093be359fb50fc01b32b3c8f2dea3f0226f8773d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;b&lt;c&lt;d$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"107\" height=\"13\" />), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/d/c2de3523737b15e606ba7d132c8761bbbaf55f94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n&gt;m-n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are integers, there are two cases we have to consider since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d2969c3bdbe54136d4f3534dca84b9f4770020.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93 = 3\\cdot 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />. We first have to consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/c/f7c2dd54fc1630aa616c235f2b4f3f9a191a9b53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-n = 1, m+n = 93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"181\" height=\"16\" />, and then consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad63cc28f64de71f2af127a9740865c3cf0c3218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-n=3, m+n = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"184\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p>In the first case, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/1/9e1fef080ba91cbccbacc9a7d040d3f18e0c821d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=47, n=46$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" /> and in the second case we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/4/6c473188b35f160a7b99a5c14be4c8df9dbe6b00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=17, n=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />. Now plug these values (in separate cases) back into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb60e0857a2c0a2c47acfbe81781032feb1f7150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. Since the only restriction is that all numbers have to be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a39b14023c98c943554d150561aacc188c4ce26d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, we can write two inequalities. Either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f34e4a3d2499a3cc0fe3b8c62f7ad97b5c227103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+47 &lt; 500, x-47 &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"194\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/d/d2db4fe4a5524b56433244499de4a43639823dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+17 &lt; 500, x-17 &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"194\" height=\"16\" /> (using the inequalities given by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are squeezed in between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we only have to consider these two inequalities).\n</p><p>This gives us either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/b/e5bfd8d345866e7808d73e1b227934c95d559b12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$47 &lt; x &lt; 453$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84e53f5731ab9904a99ba17838b573fdf3a9f42c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17 &lt; x &lt; 483$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" />, and using simple counting, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc228bd77701d8bed244703342dd3cee93bd56c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the first case and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae47528e052e84ea2bdabeb381af47f83bf7809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$465$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the second case, and hence our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/72010d126cdbd45ad71612073432b16c5851a881.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405+465 = \\boxed{870}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME\" title=\"1993 AIME\">1993 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183803\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.100 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 902/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 29098/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.851      1 -total\n 57.74%    7.998      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.72%    5.501      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2944:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017183803 and revision id 293028. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}